            "review_title": "Review at Trau Kinh Bac - Duong bao bien cot 5",
            "review_text": "Agape Travel Vietnam\nHanoi, Vietnam40 contributions\n0\nOne of the best restaurant\nAug 2022\nI tried many different bufalo meat dish in Bac Ninh, and when I came to Halong, I was supprised, there is one in Halong OMG, but if you want to try this kind of meat, you should come to Trau Kinh Bac, It will suprise you with a raw bufalo meat moving in front of your eyes, it's considered extremely fresh meat.\nWritten December 9, 2022",
