            "review_title": "Review at Trau Kinh Bac - Duong bao bien cot 5",
            "review_text": "Adele A\n1 contribution\n1\nFantastic Restaurant\nJun 2019 • Friends\nThis has become one of my favourite restaurant's. They are famous for their buffalo but they have a great variety of food to choose from. The staff are always friendly and never keep you waiting. The food is very well priced and you always get more than expected. I would recommend this Restaurant to everyone.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 14, 2019",
